# Local work, GitHub production

Joana always develops this project **locally** in this folder. Production updates go **only** through GitHub account **ilievska156**.

- Edit, run, and test with the local app (`npm run dev`, local files).
- When she asks to push or ship to production, commit (if she asked) and `git push` to `https://github.com/ilievska156/Mars-RedHorizon.git`, usually `main`.
- Do not push to any other GitHub account or fork.
- Do not use HostGator/SFTP as the production workflow.
- Before pushing, confirm `git remote get-url origin` is that ilievska156 URL. If it is not, stop and fix origin.
